    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d277">

                <pb facs="0442" n="354" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv02/pg354"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 772.73/1: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Page</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Commission to Negotiate Peace
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-09">December 9,
                            1918</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4. For your information. Important. I have learned that on December 6th,
                    delegates from the Montenegrin Stuppina, 18 in number, left for Belgrade to
                    proclaim annexation to Serbia. It is confirmed by pro-Serbians that Montenegro
                    is discontented.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson Page</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
